; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Amharic / አማርኛ (am)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

አንቀሳቅስ counter 5

launch_loop:
ሲስተም_ጥራ counter
ቀንስ counter 1
አወዳድር counter 0
እኩል_ካልሆነ launch_loop

; Blastoff!
አንቀሳቅስ box 999
ሲስተም_ጥራ box
